    "tint": "#bcd3e6",
    "effect": "snow"
   },
   "intro": "*The road is gone. An avalanche took the whole bend, and the snow still hisses as it settles.*\n\n*A Delibird drops out of the grey sky and lands in front of you. Its sack is empty. Pinned to it, a note: medicine, by nightfall.*\n\n**Sled driver, Halden Vey:** \"Five crates. Five houses. The Stantler can pull five. Slowly. You decide.\"",
   "choices": [
    {
     "label": "Take the sled.",
     "success": {
      "text": "You step onto the runners. The Delibird perches on the front rail and watches you the whole way.",
      "effects": [
       {
        "kind": "flag",
        "key": "sv-entered",
        "amount": 1
       },
       {
        "kind": "gn",
        "op": "scene",
        "key": "gn-n19-load"
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "label": "Walk on.",
     "success": {
      "text": "You walk on. Behind you, the Delibird stays where it landed, sack open, looking at the road.",
      "effects": []
     }
    }
   ]
  },
