     "label": "Say you remember.",
     "success": {
      "text": "You tell them you remember. You tell them you are sorry, for the house, for the winter, for the crate that never came.\n\n**Grown child:** \"We were fine. I mean that. We were fine, and we're well, and I wanted you to know it.\"",
